		"The command /sethome lets u set a teleport that u can teleport to anytime with /home. By pressing B u can create a waypoint at your feet which u can check on by pressing J and opening up the journeymap waypoints. U can then teleport to the waypoint from journeymap's waypoint list. Journeymap teleporting is disabled by default so turn cheats on,",
